{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor TD</strong> is a <strong>tactical tower-defense roguelite</strong> taking place in <strong>Ancient Greece</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine</strong> tower defense <strong>planning</strong>, roguelite <strong>progression</strong>, and real-time <strong>crowd control</strong> to outsmart your enemies and endure as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to repel hordes <strong>using your environment</strong>: place towers, traps, and walls to redirect enemies <strong>into deadly kill-zones</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> divine favors, <strong>upgrade</strong> your defenses, and <strong>experiment</strong> with different builds to <strong>push further</strong> each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for replayability</strong>, Survivor TD blends <strong>fast-paced combat</strong> with <strong>strategic construction</strong>, offering a <strong>unique twist</strong> on the survivor and tower-defense genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/2ef346d821aa471ea96957ee5e043c0e.webp?t=1773435317\" width=1143 height=43 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of monsters coming in waves in Survivor TD, a tower-defense mixed with roguelite gameplay.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811540/extras/7a8193b9afff2ae2a9da2e157e5c4544.poster.avif?t=1773435317\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as